# NO CONTENT LINES HERE, DELIBERATELY - and the build refuses them.
#
# DET is whichever courses declare @@PARENT: det - DET 102, DET 130, DET 330 and
# DET 403 as of 2026-10-27. Its page list is the union of what they carry, in the order
# the sidebar shows them, first occurrence winning. When a course diverges the
# programme follows on the next build with nothing edited here.
